              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "How to read this report",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#01305C"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Start on the Executive Summary: four headline KPIs, the scorecard (on track, watch, act now), and what went well, what is a problem and the actions to take. Every number in those statements is calculated from the data.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt",
                      "color": "#33475B"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Period buttons (Month, QTD, YTD, Last 12M) set the window for every page. Each window ends with the last month of actuals (Oct 31, 2026). Balances (cash, receivables, inventory, DSO, DIO) are at that month end.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt",
                      "color": "#33475B"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Comparisons: actual vs budget for the same window, and vs the same months last year. Full-year outlook = actual to date plus the rolling forecast for the rest of the year. Forecast runs to Dec 2027.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt",
                      "color": "#33475B"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Colors: green is better than target, amber is just behind (watch), red needs action. On trend charts navy is actual, gold dashed is forecast, grey dashed is budget.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt",
                      "color": "#33475B"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Pages: Trends & Forecast, Income Statement, Revenue & Margin Drivers, Customers & Products, Labor & Stores, Working Capital & Balance Sheet, Cash Flow & Liquidity, Capital Projects, Risks & Early Warnings.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt",
                      "color": "#33475B"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
